    "answer": {
      "short": "$40.9\\text{ m}$",
      "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}P&=l+2r\\\\P&=\\frac{120}{360}\\times2\\pi(10)+2(10)\\\\P&=\\frac{20\\pi}{3}+20\\\\P&\\approx40.9\\text{ m}\\end{aligned}$",
